* ASHBY-BEER 2D POLICY BIFURCATION & ATTRACTOR-BASIN MAP (DYNAMO-X)
* Sweeps Conservation (CONS) x Abatement (ABAT) across 6 coupled regions
* (Tier 1 exact TF36 ODEs + Tier 2 T-Fabric TBFP-9 inter-regional coupling!)

SPEC DT=2.0, LENGTH=2070.0, TSTART=1970.0, PRTPER=50.0, METHOD=EULER, REGIONS=6

C CONS = 0.50
C ABAT = 0.50

N POP = 1.00
N RES = 1.35
N POL = 0.20

A REFF.K = RES.K / (RES.K + 0.35)
A OUTP.K = POP.K * REFF.K
A PSTR.K = POL.K / (1.0 + POL.K)

R DPOP.KL = POP.K * (0.048 * REFF.K * (1.0 - POP.K / 2.5) - 0.008 - 0.035 * PSTR.K)
R DRES.KL = -0.032 * (1.0 - 0.82 * CONS) * OUTP.K + 0.014 * CONS * (1.25 - RES.K)
R DPOL.KL = 0.070 * (1.0 - 0.85 * ABAT) * OUTP.K - 0.095 * POL.K

L POP.K = POP.J + DT * DPOP.JK
L RES.K = RES.J + DT * DRES.JK
L POL.K = POL.J + DT * DPOL.JK

* Inter-regional trade & resource sharing dispatched to 27-tile T-Fabric (TBFP-9)!
COUPLE POP = 0.02
COUPLE RES = 0.04

* Ashby Essential Variable Corridors -> Native Kleene +1 / 0 / -1 Map
ASHBY POP IN [0.70, 3.00]
ASHBY RES IN [0.40, 2.50]
ASHBY POL IN [0.00, 1.20]

SWEEP CONS = 0.10..0.90 STEP 0.20, ABAT = 0.10..0.90 STEP 0.20
